 "about": {
  "text": "The first edition of the Zurich Kurdish Film Festival will take place from November 19 to 22, 2026, at the Xenix and Kinokoni movie theaters as well as at the Kunstraum Walcheturm. The festival will feature films by Kurdish directors as well as works that explore the realities of Kurdish life. Through a diverse program of films and accompanying events, the festival aims to highlight different Kurdish perspectives and situate the films within their cultural, historical, and political contexts. The festival sees itself as a place of encounter and exchange, where Kurdish history, the present, and the future are collectively reflected upon and explored further.",
  "lang": "en",
  "venue": "Xenix",
  "url": "https://www.xenix.ch/programm/november-2026/kurdisches-filmfestival-zuerich",
  "translated": true
 },
